        {
          "source_id": "foundation02-language-first10-oxford-request",
          "status": "verified",
          "scope": "Verified selected ordinary-language consultation within root independent AI acceptance. Source finding: The noun can describe an act of asking or the thing asked for. The register tendency and written-message use support the original definition and retained sent-request example. The verb and machine-service request are outside this decision. Literal selected source level: not observed. Other-sense labels not applied: {}. Independent decision: Accept the ordinary asking noun and optional polite/formal tendency. Editorial B1 is appropriate for the bounded support-message example; preserve literal Collins B1+ without asserting equivalence. Software requests and musical requests remain distinct. No human, subject-matter, morphology, media, domain, expression or release approval is claimed."
        },
