          "scope": "Verified selected ordinary-language consultation within root independent AI acceptance. Source finding: The countable entry describes something a person is told to do and marks it usually plural. Separate sections cover detailed how-to information, computer operations and teaching. This supports the single-direction definition and each instruction example. Literal selected source level: not observed. Other-sense labels not applied: {\"computer_instruction\":\"B2\"}. Independent decision: Accept countable direction and the more natural each instruction example. Editorial A2 is a pedagogical decision for routine directions. Do not transfer plural how-to A2, computer B2, or uncountable teaching to the selected countable noun. No human, subject-matter, morphology, media, domain, expression or release approval is claimed."
        },
