          "status": "verified",
          "scope": "Verified selected ordinary-language consultation within root independent AI acceptance. Source finding: The countable direction or order is separate from the plural how-to information entry. A2 is displayed for that plural entry, not the selected countable direction. The teaching sense is also distinct. Literal selected source level: not observed. Other-sense labels not applied: {\"plural_how_to_instructions\":\"A2\"}. Independent decision: Accept countable direction and the more natural each instruction example. Editorial A2 is a pedagogical decision for routine directions. Do not transfer plural how-to A2, computer B2, or uncountable teaching to the selected countable noun. No human, subject-matter, morphology, media, domain, expression or release approval is claimed."
        }
