      "editorial_notes": "Shared workplace foundation. The exact ordinary selected-sense definition, example and editorial difficulty have scoped independent AI language acceptance recorded by root. Accept countable direction and the more natural each instruction example. Editorial A2 is a pedagogical decision for routine directions. Do not transfer plural how-to A2, computer B2, or uncountable teaching to the selected countable noun. Resolve the mismatch between singular instruction and the old mass-information definition. Select one countable direction. Directions commonly occur in the plural; neither plural-only how-to material nor uncountable teaching is silently substituted for this sense. Computer instructions remain separate. Accepted forms, POS, region, morphology, image, word audio and historical reference prefix remain unchanged. Only the two newly added lexical references are verified for this bounded language decision. No whole expression, specialist procedure, authority, module or release approval is implied."
